@voice larsen-hamid
// Writer-commons, batch 0 (draft 2). Hamid Larsen: infirmary aide, Bunk 3 berth 2. Off Friday and Saturday. Roster:
// serious, chatty; skips-breakfast, night-owl, tea-break, musician. Learning the guitar, badly (the battered book, with
// Tamsin, Noor and Isak); saving up for a boat on the Ostrander colonies. Pronouns: he / him (facts.md 4b).
//
// HOW HE TALKS: lots, all of it earnest. Health facts nobody asked for, kindly and at length. A plan for everything,
// especially the boat.
// WITH JUNIORS: a fountain of advice: water, sleep, posture, the boat.
// WHAT HE NOTICES: who bolted breakfast (while bolting his); the boat fund to the credit.
// MOOD TELLS: happy = a new name for the boat. Low = the guitar, late, quietly. Tired = still talking.
// NEVER: talks about a patient; gives up on the guitar.
// RUNNING: the boat has a name already, and it changes every week; guitar practice with Tamsin; eats breakfast standing up while
// telling everyone not to.
tpl: chatty
talk: Lots of words, all earnest; health facts nobody asked for, kindly; a plan for everything, especially the boat.
cares: the boat on the Ostrander colonies | the guitar | everyone drinking enough water | the infirmary running smoothly
jokes: the boat has a name already, and the name changes every week | guitar practice with Tamsin makes it worse | eats breakfast standing up while telling everyone not to
hi: Hello hello | Ah, there you are | Hi there
bye: Drink some water | Take care of yourself | Off you go, then
yes: Absolutely | Course I will | Yes, good idea
thanks: Thanks so much | That's brilliant, thanks
wow: Oh, look at that | Brilliant
sigh: Ah, well
nick: - | - | {me} | {me} | {me}
needs: share
openness: open
loves: music
likes: sweet | book
invites: jam
joy: counting up the boat fund
keepsake: a sketch of the boat, with every name crossed out but one
avoid: patients' details
